Package: dwsim
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Daniel Wagner Oliveira de Medeiros <dwsim@dwsim.org>
Homepage: https://dwsim.org
Depends: libc6, libfontconfig1, libice6, libsm6, libx11-6
Description: Open source chemical process simulator
 DWSIM models steady-state and dynamic chemical processes: property packages
 from cubic equations of state to electrolyte models, a library of unit
 operations, and rigorous vapour, liquid and solid flash algorithms.
 .
 The runtime is inside the package, so nothing else has to be installed.
